WEBVTT

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.536
Please help me!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.640
Help me! Please, help me!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.376
Jack: Get him out of here!
Get him away from the engine!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.664
Get him out of here!

00:06:40.688 --> 00:06:46.776
(Engine roaring)

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.136
C: Help me, please!
I'm having contractions!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.896
J: How many months pregnant are you?

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.376
C: I'm only eight months.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.216
J: And how far apart are they coming?

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:57.280
C: I don't know. I think it just happened.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.720
Man: Hey! Hey! Hey, get away from --